{"ref":"core-es:item:001438","lang":"en","text":"At the bakery they recommended today's bread.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001439","lang":"en","text":"I came home with two full boxes.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001440","lang":"en","text":"I put the butter and the milk in the fridge.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001441","lang":"en","text":"I made a salad with lettuce, carrot and oil.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001442","lang":"en","text":"Last Sunday we were out in the country.","type":"natural"}
