{"ref":"core-es:item:001444","lang":"en","text":"We walked along a long path to a bridge.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001445","lang":"en","text":"Next to the lake there were horses and cows.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001446","lang":"en","text":"We ate in the woods, under a tree.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001447","lang":"en","text":"At night you could see the moon and lots of stars.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001448","lang":"en","text":"I couldn't remember such a quiet Sunday.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001449","lang":"en","text":"I started at the new company in March.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001450","lang":"en","text":"I was very nervous on the first day.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001451","lang":"en","text":"An employee showed me the office.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001452","lang":"en","text":"My boss explained the team's project to me.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001453","lang":"en","text":"I worked all morning in front of a screen.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001454","lang":"en","text":"Nobody talked to me about the salary that day.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001455","lang":"en","text":"I decided to ask on Monday.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001456","lang":"en","text":"Last week my back hurt a lot.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001457","lang":"en","text":"My neck hurt in the mornings too.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001458","lang":"en","text":"I asked for an appointment at the health centre.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001459","lang":"en","text":"The doctor looked at my back and my neck.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001460","lang":"en","text":"He told me it was a muscle and nothing more.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001461","lang":"en","text":"He gave me some tablets for a week.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001462","lang":"en","text":"Now I'm much better, just a little weak.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001463","lang":"en","text":"When I was a child, I used to spend the summers at my grandmother's.","type":"natural","note":"The imperfect for what used to happen, which is the tense this passage exists to show."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001464","lang":"en","text":"The house was old and had a very big mirror on the wall.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001465","lang":"en","text":"In the dining room there was a wooden lamp.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001466","lang":"en","text":"My grandmother used to tell stories at night.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001467","lang":"en","text":"My cousin and I used to play on the floor.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001468","lang":"en","text":"In the bathroom there were always soap and clean towels.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001469","lang":"en","text":"We had no wifi and we didn't need it.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001470","lang":"en","text":"I was born in that house and I still remember it well.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001471","lang":"en","text":"Last Saturday we walked around the town centre.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001472","lang":"en","text":"We started in the square, next to the church.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001473","lang":"en","text":"The walk to the theatre was short.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001474","lang":"en","text":"We bought bread at a bakery on the corner.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001475","lang":"en","text":"From the bridge you could see the whole city.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001476","lang":"en","text":"Upstairs, the theatre was too full.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001477","lang":"en","text":"We took a walk around the square and went home.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001478","lang":"en","text":"Last year I was studying Spanish two days a week.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001479","lang":"en","text":"There were eight of us students and a very calm teacher.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001480","lang":"en","text":"She used to teach us a new phrase every day.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001481","lang":"en","text":"I used to write all the letters in my notebook.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001482","lang":"en","text":"The first few days I understood almost nothing.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001483","lang":"en","text":"The teacher would repeat the exercise slowly.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001484","lang":"en","text":"After a while, everything seemed easier.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001485","lang":"en","text":"I never forgot that class.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001486","lang":"en","text":"Last night we had dinner at a new restaurant.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001487","lang":"en","text":"The waitress offered us a table next to the window.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001488","lang":"en","text":"They served the rice very hot and it was delicious.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001489","lang":"en","text":"My sister is vegetarian and ordered pasta with vegetables.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001490","lang":"en","text":"Each person had two napkins.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001491","lang":"en","text":"I didn't fancy anything else, just a coffee.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001492","lang":"en","text":"We paid in cash and left a tip.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001493","lang":"en","text":"Everything worked perfectly and we're going to go back.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001494","lang":"en","text":"Last month I sold my old guitar.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001495","lang":"en","text":"I had it in the wardrobe, in a grey box.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001496","lang":"en","text":"I offered it in a city magazine.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001497","lang":"en","text":"I tried the newspaper too, but nobody called.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001498","lang":"en","text":"A foreigner bought it on Thursday.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001499","lang":"en","text":"He paid me in cash and I took the money out of my bag.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001500","lang":"en","text":"The guitar had been mine since I was a child and I remember it well.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001501","lang":"en","text":"Last night I hardly slept at all.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001502","lang":"en","text":"The neighbours upstairs were very noisy.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001503","lang":"en","text":"Normally they're quiet, but not last night.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001504","lang":"en","text":"My stomach hurt and I didn't want to eat either.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001505","lang":"en","text":"I drank too much coffee in the afternoon, maybe that's why.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001506","lang":"en","text":"This morning I felt very weak.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001507","lang":"en","text":"I slept all afternoon and now I'm better.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001508","lang":"en","text":"I packed the suitcase the night before the trip.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001509","lang":"en","text":"I took two shirts and a belt out of the wardrobe.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001510","lang":"en","text":"I put in six socks, because they're never enough.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001511","lang":"en","text":"My grey hat wouldn't fit in the suitcase.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001512","lang":"en","text":"Then I left it at home and took the small bag.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001513","lang":"en","text":"I booked a double room for two nights.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001514","lang":"en","text":"We left together very early and the journey lasted three hours.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001515","lang":"en","text":"Last summer we crossed the border by coach.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001516","lang":"en","text":"My cousin was driving and I was watching the road.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001517","lang":"en","text":"We booked the tickets a week before.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001518","lang":"en","text":"The journey lasted nine hours and we arrived at night.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001519","lang":"en","text":"At the hotel there was a foreigner who spoke four languages.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001520","lang":"en","text":"He showed us a very quiet spot near the lake.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001521","lang":"en","text":"We paid everything in cash because they did not want cards.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001522","lang":"en","text":"It was a great trip and we are going back together.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001523","lang":"en","text":"The company moved office in September.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001524","lang":"en","text":"An employee showed us the team room.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001525","lang":"en","text":"Each desk had a big screen and a lamp.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001526","lang":"en","text":"The walls were grey and the floor wooden.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001527","lang":"en","text":"My boss explained that the project depended on two people.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001528","lang":"en","text":"We had to finish before December.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001529","lang":"en","text":"Nobody mentioned the salary, and that seemed normal to me.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001530","lang":"en","text":"I liked the new office, maybe because of the light.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001531","lang":"en","text":"Yesterday we had an exam and I was very nervous.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001532","lang":"en","text":"There were twenty of us students in a small room.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001533","lang":"en","text":"The teacher wrote a sentence on the wall.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001534","lang":"en","text":"I wrote all the letters into my notebook.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001535","lang":"en","text":"I did not understand the first exercise properly.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001536","lang":"en","text":"I tried again and afterwards it seemed easy.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001537","lang":"en","text":"I finished ten minutes before time.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001538","lang":"en","text":"The teacher showed us the answers afterwards.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001539","lang":"en","text":"On Friday I cooked for four friends.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001540","lang":"en","text":"I bought grapes, strawberries, lettuce and two carrots.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001541","lang":"en","text":"I made the pasta with garlic and plenty of oil.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001542","lang":"en","text":"One friend is vegetarian, so I served two dishes.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001543","lang":"en","text":"I put a napkin next to each plate.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001544","lang":"en","text":"Everything was delicious, or so they told me.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001545","lang":"en","text":"I recommended the strawberries with sugar and they were all gone.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001546","lang":"en","text":"Nobody left a tip at my house, of course.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001547","lang":"en","text":"When we went in, the house was empty.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001548","lang":"en","text":"There was only an old lamp on the floor.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001549","lang":"en","text":"The walls looked ugly and the wood very old.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001550","lang":"en","text":"In the bathroom there were no towels and no soap.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001551","lang":"en","text":"The fridge was open and did not work.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001552","lang":"en","text":"I took out two bags of rubbish the first day.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001553","lang":"en","text":"A chair fell over when I touched it.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001554","lang":"en","text":"Now the house looks different and I think about that day often.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001555","lang":"en","text":"Last winter it snowed a lot in the village.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001556","lang":"en","text":"In the morning there were low clouds and it was very cold.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001557","lang":"en","text":"The horses and the cows were in the wooden building.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001558","lang":"en","text":"The path to the bridge was white.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001559","lang":"en","text":"The lake looked grey from the woods.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001560","lang":"en","text":"At night the moon and the stars came out.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001561","lang":"en","text":"I never saw such a quiet place.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001562","lang":"en","text":"Last week I lost my bag at the theatre.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001563","lang":"en","text":"I had a magazine, my keys and a belt in it.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001564","lang":"en","text":"I went back to the corner by the church, but it was not there.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001565","lang":"en","text":"I forgot to ask at the bakery next door.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001566","lang":"en","text":"Two days later I got a message from the theatre.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001567","lang":"en","text":"I found out someone had left it in a box.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001568","lang":"en","text":"They sent me a message with the address.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001569","lang":"en","text":"Everything was there, even the socks and the hat.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001570","lang":"en","text":"I had a doctor appointment on Tuesday afternoon.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001571","lang":"en","text":"My neck hurt and my stomach did too.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001572","lang":"en","text":"He pressed the muscle in my neck slowly.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001573","lang":"en","text":"He looked at the skin on my back very slowly.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001574","lang":"en","text":"He said it was normal and that it was nothing.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001575","lang":"en","text":"He gave me some tablets and recommended sleeping more.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001576","lang":"en","text":"The health centre was full and I waited a good while.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001577","lang":"en","text":"I came out calmer, but still a little weak.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001578","lang":"en","text":"Last month I told my sister a lie.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001579","lang":"en","text":"It was nothing big, but I felt bad for a while.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001580","lang":"en","text":"I told her I had no money for the trip.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001581","lang":"en","text":"The truth was different and she found out.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001582","lang":"en","text":"She forgave me in a very calm way.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001583","lang":"en","text":"She told me she did something similar as a girl.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001584","lang":"en","text":"I decided not to forget that day.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001585","lang":"en","text":"Maybe small lies are harder.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001586","lang":"en","text":"On Sunday we watched a match with the neighbours.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001587","lang":"en","text":"There were eight of us all together in the living room.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001588","lang":"en","text":"One team wore blue shirts and the other white.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001589","lang":"en","text":"The match lasted two hours and was great.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001590","lang":"en","text":"The neighbours were very noisy, but nobody said anything.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001591","lang":"en","text":"We ate too much and drank enough coffee.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001592","lang":"en","text":"When it finished, we were all tired and happy.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001593","lang":"en","text":"Normally the rubbish lorry comes very early.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001594","lang":"en","text":"It goes past the corner by the church at six.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001595","lang":"en","text":"This morning it woke me because it was very noisy.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001596","lang":"en","text":"I live upstairs and the window was open.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001597","lang":"en","text":"I went out with two bags of rubbish just filled.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001598","lang":"en","text":"The man working there said good morning and carried on.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001599","lang":"en","text":"Afterwards I could not sleep and made breakfast.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001600","lang":"en","text":"The old fridge stopped working in August.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001601","lang":"en","text":"We had to buy another one, but we did not have enough money.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001602","lang":"en","text":"We sold the dining room table to a neighbour.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001603","lang":"en","text":"With that we paid for almost all of the new fridge.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001604","lang":"en","text":"They sent it to the house on Tuesday afternoon.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001605","lang":"en","text":"We also got two new towels.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001606","lang":"en","text":"The wifi was not working that day and I could not pay by phone.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001607","lang":"en","text":"Now the kitchen looks different.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001608","lang":"en","text":"Yesterday we ate at the restaurant on the corner.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001609","lang":"en","text":"The waitress was new and a little nervous.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001610","lang":"en","text":"She offered us the set menu and two napkins.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001611","lang":"en","text":"She served the soup very slowly and everything was fine.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001612","lang":"en","text":"My brother is vegetarian and she made him another dish.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001613","lang":"en","text":"We waited a good while, but we said nothing.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001614","lang":"en","text":"We left her a good tip on the way out.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001615","lang":"en","text":"Last Saturday I fell over in the woods.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001616","lang":"en","text":"I was going by bike along a very bad path.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001617","lang":"en","text":"My hand hurt and there was a little blood.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001618","lang":"en","text":"A muscle in my leg hurt too.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001619","lang":"en","text":"A man with two horses helped me a lot.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001620","lang":"en","text":"The skin on my hand was red, nothing more.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001621","lang":"en","text":"I made an appointment for Monday morning.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001622","lang":"en","text":"At night there were clouds and you could not see the stars.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001623","lang":"en","text":"Last summer I found a notebook of my grandfather's.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001624","lang":"en","text":"He was born in a small, poor village.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001625","lang":"en","text":"His handwriting was big and very clear.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001626","lang":"en","text":"In the first sentence he told a story of his mother's.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001627","lang":"en","text":"He started writing at the age of ten.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001628","lang":"en","text":"My mother showed me two more notebooks.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001629","lang":"en","text":"I understood better where my family came from.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001630","lang":"en","text":"It was the most human thing I read that year.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001631","lang":"en","text":"In April we crossed the border by coach.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001632","lang":"en","text":"My sister was driving and I was sleeping beside her.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001633","lang":"en","text":"We booked a small hotel for two nights.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001634","lang":"en","text":"When we arrived we walked around the square.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001635","lang":"en","text":"I did not understand anything and neither did she.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001636","lang":"en","text":"We tried to talk to a woman from the church.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001637","lang":"en","text":"She explained everything to us perfectly and very slowly.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001638","lang":"en","text":"The trip lasted three days and I never forgot that village.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001639","lang":"en","text":"Yesterday I listened to the news in the kitchen.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001640","lang":"en","text":"The first news item lasted less than a minute.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001641","lang":"en","text":"Then they talked about the rain for twenty seconds.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001642","lang":"en","text":"A woman told the story in a very calm way.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001643","lang":"en","text":"She said the first news item was a lie.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001644","lang":"en","text":"I got a message from my sister about the same thing.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001645","lang":"en","text":"I sent her the news and waited for her reply.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001646","lang":"en","text":"We should have talked about it, but there was no time.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001647","lang":"en","text":"On Sunday my mother showed me an old photo.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001648","lang":"en","text":"My uncle was very fat and my aunt very thin.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001649","lang":"en","text":"They were both wearing a rather ugly hat.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001650","lang":"en","text":"My cousin looked similar to me as a child.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001651","lang":"en","text":"The family was poor and lived in a village.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001652","lang":"en","text":"My mother told a story about her grandmother.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001653","lang":"en","text":"It was the most human moment of the whole day.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001654","lang":"en","text":"On Monday I went to the health centre at eight.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001655","lang":"en","text":"There were a lot of people and I waited more than an hour.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001656","lang":"en","text":"The whole health centre was very kind to people.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001657","lang":"en","text":"They took blood from my arm very slowly.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001658","lang":"en","text":"The skin on my arm was red afterwards.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001659","lang":"en","text":"I washed my hands with soap before leaving.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001660","lang":"en","text":"I asked for another appointment for May.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001661","lang":"en","text":"I came out with clean hands and in a bit of a hurry.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001662","lang":"en","text":"On Tuesday it snowed from very early on.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001663","lang":"en","text":"It never snows like this in this city.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001664","lang":"en","text":"The wifi stopped working and I could not work.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001665","lang":"en","text":"Everything depended on one old line in the street.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001666","lang":"en","text":"We spent the afternoon together around the table.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001667","lang":"en","text":"The fridge was full, so we ate well.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001668","lang":"en","text":"At night you could see the moon between the clouds.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001669","lang":"en","text":"The wifi came back at eleven at night.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001670","lang":"en","text":"In March we started a project in the Spanish class.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001671","lang":"en","text":"There were four of us students and we had two weeks.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001672","lang":"en","text":"Each of us had to write an exercise.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001673","lang":"en","text":"I did not start on the first day, nor on the second.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001674","lang":"en","text":"One student did it all perfectly in one afternoon.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001675","lang":"en","text":"The teacher said a teacher's salary is small.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001676","lang":"en","text":"But everyone liked the project a lot.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001677","lang":"en","text":"On Saturday I sold vegetables at the market with my uncle.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001678","lang":"en","text":"We took grapes, garlic and two boxes of strawberries.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001679","lang":"en","text":"A waitress from the bar bought almost everything.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001680","lang":"en","text":"She paid us with cash and a few notes.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001681","lang":"en","text":"By two the table was empty.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001682","lang":"en","text":"My uncle said it was a great day.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001683","lang":"en","text":"I bought a magazine and a coffee before going back.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001684","lang":"en","text":"On Sunday my brother had an important match.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001685","lang":"en","text":"He looked for the clean socks in the wardrobe.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001686","lang":"en","text":"He could not find the belt and left without it.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001687","lang":"en","text":"I drove to the pitch, very slowly.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001688","lang":"en","text":"The match lasted almost two hours.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001689","lang":"en","text":"Afterwards we told my mother about the match like a story.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001690","lang":"en","text":"She listened to it all and said nothing about the clothes.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001691","lang":"en","text":"Last year we worked out the cost of the trip.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001692","lang":"en","text":"The train tickets cost two hundred euros.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001693","lang":"en","text":"The hotel at the border was asking three hundred for three nights.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001694","lang":"en","text":"Another hotel nearer the centre cost four hundred.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001695","lang":"en","text":"The week's food came to five hundred euros.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001696","lang":"en","text":"A small car for two days cost six hundred.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001697","lang":"en","text":"A bigger one cost seven or eight hundred.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001698","lang":"en","text":"The whole trip did not reach nine hundred euros.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001699","lang":"en","text":"Everything depended on the hotel, and the one at the border was the best.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001700","lang":"en","text":"I have two cousins and they are not at all alike.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001701","lang":"en","text":"The older one is fat and very calm.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001702","lang":"en","text":"The younger one is thin and talks a lot.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001703","lang":"en","text":"As children they wore rather ugly clothes.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001704","lang":"en","text":"The family was poor, but there was always food.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001705","lang":"en","text":"They are both good people, in a very human way.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001706","lang":"en","text":"Now they live together in the same city.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001707","lang":"en","text":"Someone in the family sees them every week.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001708","lang":"en","text":"In August we spent three days in the country.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001709","lang":"en","text":"There was a very old cow next to the house.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001710","lang":"en","text":"Another cow had just had a newborn calf.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001711","lang":"en","text":"I saw a little blood on the ground.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001712","lang":"en","text":"The man from the country explained to me that it was normal.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001713","lang":"en","text":"In a second the animal got up on its own.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001714","lang":"en","text":"I never saw anything like it, not even on television.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001715","lang":"en","text":"We came home together very happy.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001716","lang":"en","text":"On Saturday I called my cousins about the match.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001717","lang":"en","text":"I asked whether the two of you were coming together.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001718","lang":"en","text":"You never arrive on time, I said.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001719","lang":"en","text":"They said that was not true, not one bit.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001720","lang":"en","text":"Someone had to bring the food and the chairs.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001721","lang":"en","text":"Afterwards they both came together, very happy.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001722","lang":"en","text":"You are the best, said my younger cousin.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001723","lang":"en","text":"In yesterday's meeting nobody said anything for a second.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001724","lang":"en","text":"Someone had said something rather ugly.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001725","lang":"en","text":"The boss is a fat man and very calm.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001726","lang":"en","text":"His brother, thinner, works at the same company.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001727","lang":"en","text":"The two are similar in the way they talk.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001728","lang":"en","text":"Nobody said anything else, neither the boss nor his brother.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001729","lang":"en","text":"A newly arrived employee started talking about something else.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001730","lang":"en","text":"After a second, we all went back to the project.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001396","lang":"en","text":"Your brother works here.","type":"natural","note":"The statement. Nothing about the words marks it as one."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001397","lang":"en","text":"Does your brother work here?","type":"natural","note":"The same five words. English needs «does»; Spanish needs the marks."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001398","lang":"en","text":"There's bread on the table.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001399","lang":"en","text":"Is there bread on the table?","type":"natural","note":"`hay` does not change to ask."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001400","lang":"en","text":"The train arrives at eight.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001401","lang":"en","text":"Does the train arrive at eight?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001402","lang":"en","text":"You speak Spanish very well.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001403","lang":"en","text":"Do you speak Spanish?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001404","lang":"en","text":"The coffee is hot.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001405","lang":"en","text":"Is the coffee hot?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001406","lang":"en","text":"You live near the museum.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001407","lang":"en","text":"Do you live near the museum?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001408","lang":"en","text":"My sister lives in Madrid.","type":"natural","note":"Ana states a fact."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001409","lang":"en","text":"Your sister lives in Madrid?","type":"natural","note":"Luis repeats it as a question. Only `mi` becomes `tu`; the shape is untouched."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001410","lang":"en","text":"Yes, she's lived there since January.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001411","lang":"en","text":"How nice! And she works at a museum?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001412","lang":"en","text":"She works at a very big museum.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001413","lang":"en","text":"Does she like the city?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001414","lang":"en","text":"She likes it a lot. She says it's perfect.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001415","lang":"en","text":"And are you going to visit your sister?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001416","lang":"en","text":"I'm going in April. I can't wait!","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001417","lang":"en","text":"The museum is close, right?","type":"natural","note":"A statement plus a tag. The sentence itself never changes."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001418","lang":"en","text":"Yes, it's very close. Ten minutes away.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001419","lang":"en","text":"And it opens in the morning, doesn't it?","type":"natural","note":"`¿no?` where the speaker expects agreement."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001420","lang":"en","text":"It opens at ten every day.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001421","lang":"en","text":"It isn't very expensive, is it?","type":"natural","note":"A tag on a negative statement keeps the same tag."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001422","lang":"en","text":"It's cheap. Five euros.","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001423","lang":"en","text":"Then let's go tomorrow, OK?","type":"natural","note":"`¿vale?` asks for agreement to a plan rather than to a fact."}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001424","lang":"en","text":"OK. At ten, then?","type":"natural"}
{"ref":"core-es:item:001425","lang":"en","text":"At ten. Now I'm sure.","type":"natural"}
